+# Actual StoragePublication: executable slice plan
+
+2026-11-09. ROOT relayed explicit user authorization for separate isolated
+implementation. This is not deployment, physical topology or positive native
+admission. Existing PR50 and its evidence remain immutable.
+
+Base3e1b4c7c65174fe5775050449162153213e62a8f,
+tree3354fe1f7e130dbaa19a8455b8f21b65f4ec067e.
+Branch feature/storage-native-publication-20261109; separate own worktree.
+
+Owned source: result_publication.py, replica_evidence.py; proposed new
+publication_records.py, publication_recovery.py; tests/storage/native_publication/**,
+docs/storage/native-publication/** and .github/workflows/storage-native-publication.yml.
+Existing A2/A5/A7 or ROOT sources are not edited here.
+
+## Required resulting behavior
+
+Only an actual A2 native transaction can publish a dataset identity, immutable
+root and committed revision with original native receipt/access scope. A local
+file/hash/replica-shaped record is insufficient. Target result stays
+LOCAL_UNATTESTED until that transaction is actually consistently resolved.
+Known commit survives lost response/projection/reassignment; UNKNOWN preserves
+original intent/holds/bytes and never creates a second request or debit.
+
+## Executable slices and dependencies
+
+1. Actual retained bytes: original producer/target requests, input closure,
+   computed artifact, descriptor and truthful source/algorithm/units/provenance.
+   Verify exact bytes/hash/length/schema and complete acyclic dependencies before
+   producing a candidate. Retain existing local copy API semantics separately.
+2. Actual destination copy/readback and verifier: distinct admitted store/node/
+   volume/incarnation/domain, current eligibility, protection/holds and issued
+   reservations. No domain label supplied in JSON proves independence. Actual
+   observations are stored only through the same A2 authority/issuer contract.
+3. Native publisher adapter: fixed A2 source/instance API, not an injected callback
+   or raw caller operation plan. A2 constructs the complete transaction checking
+   assignment supersession/attempt/cancel, current closure/replicas/holds/budgets,
+   dataset CAS/original idempotency/access and atomically writes root/revision/
+   receipt/protection/accounting. Exact schemas and key-to-CAS mapping co-ACK
+   A2/A4/A5 before positive wiring. Fully encode/measure every actual plan.
+4. Reconciliation/recovery: consistent same-original lookup under current rights;
+   immutable exact native KV Value receipt bytes plus external actual ModifyIndex.
+   Crash before send, uncertain send, commit-before-response and projection crash
+   are distinct. Never reconstruct an opaque proof from JSON or retry with a new
+   key. Physical corruption/loss revokes eligibility and blocks further unsafe
+   publication; all-lost produces explicit unavailable/unrecoverable ranges.
+5. Existing A7 ResultStore projection/read: only an actual consistently resolved
+   receipt, exact artifact/root/revision/identity and current READ scope admit
+   durable projection/disclosure. Shared exact API and error/codecs co-ACK owners.
+   A6 receives actual scientific bytes/descriptor, never metadata-only chart data.
+
+## Work proceeding before interface freeze
+
+Read-only source inventory, exact byte/semantic fixture graph, explicit topology
+and commissioning requirements, interruption matrix, and independent local
+verification tests may proceed. Do not guess native success records, create a
+parallel state/receipt registry, or turn an always-denied seam into DTO success.
+New authority record names and shared signatures stay proposed until owner co-ACK.
+
+## Domain qualification and stop gate
+
+No admitted two-independent-domain storage laboratory exists in current A4
+evidence. Two folders, volumes in one physical disk, processes or containers on
+this Windows machine cannot establish independent host/media failure domains.
+Concrete provisioning requirements are recorded separately. Without actual
+policy-qualified topology, distributed publication positive stays BLOCKED, even
+if local filesystem and actual logical Consul process tests pass.
+
+## Verification gates
+
+TDD for each owned behavior; actual bounded byte corruption/loss/short-write/
+ENOSPC/flush interruption tests; real same-authority stale-owner/no-quorum/CAS/
+duplicate/concurrent/crash tests after fixed A2 API admission; actual distinct
+domain loss/readback tests before qualifying replica policy; existing-store
+projection/access/receipt tests after A7 interface admission; independent exact
+source review and fresh primary source guard. No broad reruns without new code,
+failures or unresolved concerns. No hosted rerun is requested by this plan.
+
+## Current ledger
+
+- Worktree and exact base verified clean; proposed paths listed to ROOT first.
+- Current A2/A5/A7 exact executable interfaces requested; ACK pending.
+- Historical local-only functions remain as PR50 until a reviewed successor.
+- No native publication, topology or global E2E PASS is claimed.
